```

**Packaged 2026.11.10 to initial candidate `de58009cada6`:** the first process starts packaged stable for two tracked writes, then starts the candidate with the same SQLite DB and workspace. Only the model completion fixture is deterministic; Gateway, owner CLI, Doctor, and SQLite are the shipped paths.

```jsonl
